sequenceDiagram
  participant UI as App UI
  participant SDK as Tevroc SDK
  participant LLM as AI service
  participant Storage as File storage

  UI->>SDK: InvokeLLM(prompt)
  SDK->>LLM: Send prompt
  LLM-->>SDK: Return result
  SDK-->>UI: Show content

  UI->>SDK: UploadFile(file)
  SDK->>Storage: Store file
  Storage-->>SDK: File ID
  SDK-->>UI: Ready for later use
